course: dictionary
lesson: 3359
title: Excite: eager, stirred up, or full of energy
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: One word can have more than one meaning. To find the right one, read the words around it. Those words are the context, and they leave clues.
explain: «if security excites you, there are legal puzzle clubs, competitions and courses built for practice.» The clubs, competitions and courses are things you join because you enjoy them, so excites means makes you feel eager and interested.
explain: Check your meaning by swapping it into the sentence. Does "if security makes you feel eager and interested" still make sense? If yes, you have found the right meaning.
fact: Excite means to make someone feel very happy, eager and full of energy.
fact: Excite can also mean to make someone nervous, upset or stirred up, as in «don't excite the dog».
fact: In science, to excite something means to give it energy so it moves or reacts more.
fact: «Excited» describes a person who feels eager, and «exciting» describes a thing that causes that feeling.
fact: The phrase «excite interest» means to make people curious and keen to find out more.
exercise: «if security excites you, there are legal puzzle clubs, competitions and courses built for practice.» What does excites mean here? | *Makes you feel eager and interested | Makes you feel cold and wet | Makes you forget everything | Makes you feel bored and tired
exercise: Mum says «don't excite the dog». What does she mean? | Don't take the dog for a walk | *Don't make the dog too wild and jumpy | Don't feed the dog | Don't let the dog sleep
exercise: Find and copy the form of excite that describes a person who feels eager. | happy | *excited | calm | sleepy
test: Ben was ___ about the trip to the zoo. | excite | *excited | excites | exciting
test: The zoo trip was ___ for Ben. | *exciting | excite | excited | excites
exam: In science, what does to excite something mean? | To freeze it solid | To paint it a bright colour | *To give it energy so it moves or reacts more | To hide it from view
